    "description": "\n      <div topic='Water Breathing' level='5'><p><h5>Water Breathing</h5></p><table width='100%' border='1' cellpadding='2' cellspacing='2' frame='VOID' rules='ROWS'><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'/><td>Transmutation<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Level:</b><br/></td><td>Cleric 3, Druid 3, Sorcerer/Wizard 3, Water 3<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Components:</b><br/></td><td>V, S, M/DF<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Casting Time:</b><br/></td><td>1 standard action<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Range:</b><br/></td><td>Touch<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Target:</b><br/></td><td>Living creatures touched<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Duration:</b><br/></td><td>2 hours/level; see text<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Saving Throw:</b><br/></td><td>Will negates (harmless)<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol='3' curcol='3'><td width='25%'><b>Spell Resistance:</b><br/></td><td>Yes (harmless)<br/></td></tr></table><p>The transmuted creatures can breathe water freely. Divide the duration evenly among all the creatures you touch.</p><p>The spell does not make creatures unable to breathe air.</p><p><i>Arcane Material Component:</i> A short reed or piece of straw.</p><p/>\n</div>\n    ",
